# stills-models — the model picker, standing still.
#
# Its own take, at a terminal small enough for the whole frame to fit the picture: the picker is as
# wide as the longest model id it could list, so on a wide terminal it runs to both edges and a crop
# cut it off. Two takes, one for each width the site shows it at, each cropped to the frame.
#
#   scripts/site-record.sh --raw web/demo-scripts/stills-models.rec
#   scripts/site-record.sh --raw --name stills-models.narrow --cols 76 web/demo-scripts/stills-models.rec
#   S=web/src/assets/captures
#   scripts/cast-still.py $S/stills-models.cast --at <still: models + 0.5> --crop 2,5,104,14 --out $S/models.svg
#   scripts/cast-still.py $S/stills-models.narrow.cast --at <same> --crop 2,5,72,14 --out $S/models.narrow.svg

#: cols 108
#: rows 24
#: model anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5
#: thinking low
#: glyphs nerd

sleep 3
mark start

log model picker
enter /model
sleep 2
type sonnet 5
sleep 2.5
log still: models
sleep 1.5
key Escape
sleep 1
mark end
